__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.DS_Store
workspace/releases/

# Local authoring scratch. Nothing in PASS reads it; deleting it cannot
# invalidate the library. See workspace/authoring/README.md.
workspace/authoring/*
!workspace/authoring/README.md
# Exception: the guided-teaching notes are the only surviving record of
# corrections given during those runs. Nothing reads them and no build touches
# them, but untracked they would exist on exactly one machine.
!workspace/authoring/art/

# Agent scratch space
tmp/

# Source archives for pressure-testing the library against real code.
# Read-only inputs, never runtime dependencies of a release, and large enough
# that committing them by accident is expensive to undo. Hard rule 1 and the
# 2026-08-15 removal of source staging both point the same way: the code under
# test lives on disk, not in the repo.
workspace/sources/
